// Written by tools/movement/onetime (docs/plans/bodies-and-movement.md, phase 1 step 10):
// don't edit it by hand. The creature's segments: the bones of the rig its walk was captured
// on (Quaternius's Superhero Male, CC0: docs/citations.md) but its fingers, at the creature's
// scale (0.6), each joint's x axis along the flex the old walk made about it; their ranges
// and strengths (tools/movement/onetime's `spec`); the bind pose its skin is made in (the
// T-pose, its arms dropped 0.96 rad); and each part, its ends points of segments.

